'''Bladewave''' is a spell that creates a series of powerful black blades of energy. This spell is similar to the [[Bladestorm]] and [[Darkwave]] spells, also used by the [[Blood Spiral]].

== History ==
Bladewave was used by [[Rassimov]] inside the [[Mausoleum of Sir Lancelot]] against [[Lok Lambert]]. The spell hit Lok, interrupting his summoning of [[Lindorm]] and allowing Rassimov to grab [[Cavalier]]'s amulet and try to summon it. {{Source|Memory Lane}} 

While attempting a surprise attack on the Huntik Team by the Temple of Poseidon, Rassimov used Bladewave on [[Dante Vale]], who dodged it. {{Source|The Unseen Guide}} 

In the surroundings of the [[Phoenix Volcano]], a Casterwill Hunter used a powered-up version of Bladewave after sacrificing a [[Nighlurker]] Titan with [[Powerlock]] against Dante, [[Montehue]], [[Tersly]] and [[Den Fears|Den]]. They all managed to dodge the spell, but it ripped a hole in the ground where it passed, leading to a lava tube in which Lok, Sophie and [[Cherit]] were, to collapse in on itself. They managed to escape in time. {{Source|The Dead Magic Island}}

